    "title": "Creazione di istanze",
    "descriptionContent": "Scopri come ogni oggetto creato da una classe sia un'istanza indipendente.",
    "shortDescriptionContent": "",
    "showInTrack": true,
    "iconBanner": null,
    "chapters": [
      {
        "id": 17680,
        "title": "Istanze",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 149925,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Vediamo come le classi ci permettono di creare molti oggetti di gioco simili all'inizio e poi di modificarli singolarmente nel tempo.</p><p>Lo faremo esaminando più da vicino i giocatori di un gioco creati a partire da una classe iniziale.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 149926,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ogni volta che creiamo un oggetto da una classe, stiamo creando quella che viene chiamata <strong>istanza</strong> di quella classe.</p><p>Crea un'istanza della classe <code>Player</code> e salvala nella costante <code>player1</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"98\" endIndex=\"101\" /><option startIndex=\"102\" endIndex=\"108\" /><option startIndex=\"108\" endIndex=\"109\" /><option startIndex=\"109\" endIndex=\"115\" /><option startIndex=\"115\" endIndex=\"116\" /><option startIndex=\"116\" endIndex=\"117\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Arya&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player1);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>new</code>, seguito da <code>Player</code> e poi <code>(</code>, <code>\"Arya\"</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 149927,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ogni istanza è indipendente. Ciò significa che quando creiamo una nuova istanza, questa <em>non</em> influisce sulle altre istanze.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Arya&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player2 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Bran&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player1);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player2);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"118\" endIndex=\"131\" /><option startIndex=\"132\" endIndex=\"133\" /><option startIndex=\"134\" endIndex=\"153\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>const player2</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>new Player(\"Bran\");</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 149928,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><em>La modifica</em> di un'istanza non influisce sulle altre istanze.</p><p>Imposta <code>player1.health</code> su <code>0</code> per vedere come la modifica di una proprietà di <code>player1</code> non influisca sulle proprietà di <code>player2</code>.<br /></p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"135\" endIndex=\"136\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Arya&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"player1.health = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player1);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player2 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Bran&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player2);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 149929,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Poiché le istanze sono indipendenti, ci permettono di tenere traccia di dati complessi, come un numero enorme di nemici in un gioco.<br /></p><p>In questo esempio, teniamo traccia di quattro giocatori e della loro salute. Un gioco reale potrebbe tenere traccia di centinaia di oggetti.<br /></p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Arya&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player2 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Bran&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player3 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sansa&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player4 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Jon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player1);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player2);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player3);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player4);\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 149930,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando ci riferiamo a un'istanza di una classe, di cosa stiamo parlando?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Un oggetto di gioco specifico creato da un modello di classe</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Il modello di classe da cui creiamo gli oggetti di gioco</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Un oggetto di gioco specifico creato da un modello di classe.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 149931,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quante istanze possiamo creare da una classe?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Quanti ne vogliamo</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Solo uno</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Quanti ne vogliamo.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 149932,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Se modificassimo le proprietà di un'istanza, cosa succederebbe alle altre istanze create dalla stessa classe?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Nulla, non sono collegati tra loro</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">A tutte le istanze vengono modificate le proprietà</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Nulla, non sono collegati tra loro.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 149933,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Se cambiassimo le proprietà di un'istanza, cosa succederebbe alla classe da cui è stata creata?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Nulla, cambierebbe solo l'istanza</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Anche le proprietà della classe cambierebbero</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Nulla, cambierebbe solo l'istanza.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 149934,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea un'istanza della classe <code>Enemy</code> e memorizzala nella costante <code>slime</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"106\" endIndex=\"109\" /><option startIndex=\"110\" endIndex=\"115\" /><option startIndex=\"115\" endIndex=\"128\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(type, health) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".type = type;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = health;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" slime = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Enemy(\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(slime);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>new</code>, seguito da <code>Enemy</code> e infine <code>(\"slime\", 30)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 149935,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea un'istanza della classe <code>Enemy</code> e memorizzala nella costante <code>goblin</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"145\" endIndex=\"148\" /><option startIndex=\"149\" endIndex=\"154\" /><option startIndex=\"154\" endIndex=\"168\" /><option startIndex=\"168\" endIndex=\"169\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(type, health) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".type = type;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = health;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" slime = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Enemy(\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" goblin = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Enemy(\" /><text value=\"&quot;goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(slime);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(goblin);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>new</code>, seguito da <code>Enemy</code> e poi <code>(\"goblin\", 50)</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 149936,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Imposta <code>slime.health</code> a metà del suo valore.<br /></p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"190\" endIndex=\"202\" /><option startIndex=\"203\" endIndex=\"204\" /><option startIndex=\"205\" endIndex=\"217\" /><option startIndex=\"218\" endIndex=\"222\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(type, health) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".type = type;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = health;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" slime = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Enemy(\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(slime);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" goblin = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Enemy(\" /><text value=\"&quot;goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"slime.health = slime.health / \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(goblin);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>slime.health</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e poi <code>slime.health</code>, <code>/ 2;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 149937,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi un altro tipo di nemico.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"170\" endIndex=\"175\" /><option startIndex=\"176\" endIndex=\"182\" /><option startIndex=\"183\" endIndex=\"184\" /><option startIndex=\"185\" endIndex=\"188\" /><option startIndex=\"189\" endIndex=\"194\" /><option startIndex=\"194\" endIndex=\"209\" /><option startIndex=\"209\" endIndex=\"210\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(type, health) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".type = type;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = health;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" slime = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Enemy(\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" goblin = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Enemy(\" /><text value=\"&quot;goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" dragon = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Enemy(\" /><text value=\"&quot;dragon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"300\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(slime);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(goblin);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(dragon);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>const</code>, seguito da <code>dragon</code> e poi <code>=</code>, <code>new</code>, <code>Enemy</code>, <code>(\"dragon\", 300)</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
